    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classQfLocatorActionsModel" kindref="compound">QfLocatorActionsModel</ref> is a model used to dislay additional actions from the result of a filter. These are displayed as contextual menu in QGIS while they are shown in a row of buttons in QField. </para>
